### example-module (Fiber) — Example resource CRUD
###
### Manual API test file for VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Routes are registered at the app root (no prefix) by
### registerExampleRoutes in register_api_router.go:
###   POST   /examples
###   GET    /examples/:id
###   GET    /examples
###   PUT    /examples/:id
###   DELETE /examples/:id
###
### Response envelope (response.RespInfo): {"code": int, "msg": string, "data": ...}
### -> the created resource's id is at JSON path `data.id`.
###
### The X-language-flag header selects the validation-error locale
### (moduleconstant.XLanguageFlag); handlers default to "en" when absent.
###
### Run requests top to bottom: `create` populates {{create.response.body.$.data.id}}
### which the Get/Update/Delete requests below reuse.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@language = en

### Create — POST /examples
# Creates a new example resource from CreateExampleReqVo (name required;
# description/status/tags optional). Returns 201 with the created
# ExampleRespVo in `data`.
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/examples
Content-Type: application/json
X-language-flag: {{language}}

{
  "name": "My Example",
  "description": "A short description of the example.",
  "status": "active",
  "tags": ["demo", "swagger"]
}

### Get — GET /examples/:id
# Fetches the example created above by id. Returns 200 with ExampleRespVo
# in `data`, or 404 if the id does not exist.
GET {{baseUrl}}/examples/{{create.response.body.$.data.id}}
X-language-flag: {{language}}

### List — GET /examples
# Lists examples with pagination and an optional status filter, bound from
# ListExamplesReqVo query params (page, page_size, status). Returns 200
# with an ExampleListRespVo (items/page/page_size/total) in `data`.
GET {{baseUrl}}/examples?page=1&page_size=20&status=active
X-language-flag: {{language}}

### Update — PUT /examples/:id
# Partially updates the example created above using UpdateExampleReqVo
# (all fields optional/pointer — omitted fields are left unchanged).
# Returns 200 with the updated ExampleRespVo in `data`.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/examples/{{create.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-language-flag: {{language}}

{
  "status": "archived",
  "tags": ["demo"]
}

### Delete — DELETE /examples/:id
# Deletes the example created above. Returns 204 No Content on success,
# or 404 if the id does not exist.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/examples/{{create.response.body.$.data.id}}
X-language-flag: {{language}}
